# Shared by the station scenarios (sb_*; e2e.py run --live): the live login, then from the hangar pad the server
# picked (it varies) to the home spot of room 1, the main deck's junction at -48,5. Every sb_ scenario starts
# there and walks back there. Waypoints from the user's recording of 2026-11-15 (.work/e2e/202650-record); each
# room has its own coordinates. Not run on its own.
include _login_live
# room 0, the hangar: to the door at x 104
walk-to 60,3
walk-to 84,0
face 0 tol 5
hold 0x41 until msg 'Changing room from 0 to 1' within 15
# room 1
walk-to -80,12
walk-to -48,5
